# Drafts stay in the owning workspace

Three levels. Do not invent a fourth.

| Level | Tree | Drafts? |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Product | hub, React, `initagent/`, … | No. Only README + LICENSE + CHANGELOG. |
| Workspace | `masstrade-workspace/`, `initagent-workspace/` | Yes. `AGENTS.md`, `docs/`, `drafts/`, `backlog.md`. |
| Binder | the developer-environment root | No. No Draft 99. |

- Write drafts in `masstrade-workspace/drafts/` or
  `pware-workspace/initagent-workspace/drafts/`.
- `pware-workspace/` itself has no drafts (it only binds nested workspaces).
- Cross-company notes that span both firms go in `docs/`, not `drafts/`.
- Do not create `drafts/` or `drafts/99.NEEDS-ATTENTION.md` in a product or
  the binder.
- What Markdown may be committed: see `docs-layout`.
